# Evaluation outputs. The e1_*.json scorecards ARE tracked: they are results,
# not build artefacts. Each costs a day of the Groq free-tier budget to produce,
# the hosted model can change under the same name, and a scorecard for a prompt
# version that has since been replaced cannot be regenerated at all -- the
# 15 Oct prompt-v3 baseline is the example. HISTORY.md and the research notes
# cite these files by path, so they have to exist in the repo. Anything else
# dropped in this folder is scratch and stays ignored.
data/eval/*
!data/eval/e1_*.json
